    "body": "Triage: enhancement · P3 · area:build · effort:medium.\nP3 - shipped macOS releases need a Gatekeeper workaround to open (wrong behaviour a user hits, with a workaround); not P1/P2 (nothing unsafe, no red gate). effort:medium - Apple signing/notarization is a known documented pattern integrated into the existing release lane (no new algorithm or format, no safety-floor surface). If the maintainer wants the macOS cut blocked until notarized, that is a maintainer re-rate, not an agent one.\n",
